<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- SkyShift exit-plan test report. Rendered by skyshift/evidence.py with stdlib
     single-pass placeholder substitution of pre-escaped fragments (no Jinja2 needed).
     Self-contained: no scripts, no external resources. -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>SkyShift exit-plan report</title>
<style>
  :root { --bg: #ffffff; --fg: #1b1f24; --muted: #57606a; --line: #d0d7de;
          --pass: #1a7f37; --fail: #cf222e; --warn: #9a6700; --warn-bg: #fff8c5; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root { --bg: #0d1117; --fg: #e6edf3; --muted: #8d96a0; --line: #30363d;
            --pass: #3fb950; --fail: #f85149; --warn: #d29922; --warn-bg: #2b2111; }
  }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); margin: 0 auto; max-width: 1100px;
         padding: 16px; font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .banner { border: 2px solid; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.15em; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
  .banner.incomplete { color: var(--warn); background: var(--warn-bg); }
  .banner.pass { color: var(--pass); }
  .banner.fail { color: var(--fail); }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 8px 0 24px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 6px 8px; text-align: left;
           vertical-align: top; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .hash, code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.82em; }
  .status.pass { color: var(--pass); font-weight: 600; }
  .status.fail { color: var(--fail); font-weight: 600; }
  .status.incomplete, .mode.qualified { color: var(--warn); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>SkyShift exit-plan test report</h1>
<p class="muted">AWS workload to Leaseweb target: discover, choose, translate, migrate, run, parity, sever, evidence.</p>

<div class="banner {{ banner_class }}">{{ banner }}</div>
<p>{{ qualification }}</p>
<p class="muted">{{ disclaimer }}</p>

<h2>Overall verdict</h2>
<p>Evidence status: <strong>{{ overall_status }}</strong>. Verdicts are computed deterministically from step records; no model output decides them.</p>

<h2>Pipeline records and hash chain</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Step</th><th>Mode</th><th>Status</th><th>Artifact SHA-256</th><th>Chain hash</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{ step_rows }}
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Final hash: <code>{{ final_hash }}</code></p>
<p class="muted">Genesis previous_hash: <code>{{ genesis_hash }}</code>. The evidence record and this HTML report are not chain inputs.</p>

<h2>Checks</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Step</th><th>Check</th><th>Status</th><th>Detail and scope</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{ check_rows }}
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>Severance drill</h2>
<p>Final: <strong>{{ sever_final }}</strong>. Scope: {{ sever_scope }}</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Attempt</th><th>Status</th><th>Blocked</th><th>Connections (host:port decision via)</th><th>Replacement (mode)</th><th>Bypasses</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{ sever_rows }}
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="muted">Every attempt is kept: an initial denial stays visible even when a later config-only replacement turns green. Proxy and radar results are scoped evidence, not proof of zero leakage.</p>

<h2>Open items</h2>
<ul>
{{ open_items }}
</ul>
</body>
</html>
